<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#194f45">
  <title>Class Pet Points · Chen Laoshi's Teaching Toolkit</title>
  <%- include('../partials/seo', { pageDescription: 'A colorful, teacher-managed classroom points tool with 24 original pets, six growth forms, optional holiday skins, private browser storage, and simple backups.' }) %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/site-theme.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/teaching-tools/class-pet-points/class-pet-points.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="pet-hero account-header-host">
    <div class="hero-shell">
      <a class="back-btn" href="/teaching-tools">← All teaching tools</a>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">A cheerful classroom motivator</p>
        <h1>Class Pet Points</h1>
        <p>Celebrate positive classroom moments as every pet hatches, grows, sparkles, and dresses up for teacher-chosen holidays.</p>
        <div class="hero-badges" aria-label="Tool highlights">
          <span>24 original pets</span>
          <span>6 growth forms</span>
          <span>Holiday skins</span>
          <span>Saved on this device</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-pets" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="hero-pet hero-pet-one"></div>
        <div class="hero-pet hero-pet-two"></div>
        <div class="hero-pet hero-pet-three"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="pet-app" id="petApp">
    <section class="privacy-note" aria-label="Student privacy reminder">
      <span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
      <p><strong>Teacher-managed and private by design.</strong> Every saved class stays only in this browser, with its own roster, pets, points, skins, and activity. Use nicknames, initials, or student numbers instead of full student names.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="class-dashboard app-card" aria-labelledby="classSettingsTitle">
      <div class="class-name-control">
        <label id="classSettingsTitle" for="classSwitcher">Saved class</label>
        <div class="class-library-row">
          <select id="classSwitcher" aria-label="Choose a saved class"></select>
          <button class="class-library-button" id="newClassButton" type="button">+ New</button>
          <button class="class-library-button class-delete-button" id="deleteClassButton" type="button">Delete</button>
        </div>
        <label class="class-name-label" for="className">Class name</label>
        <input id="className" maxlength="60" value="My Class" autocomplete="off">
        <p id="saveStatus">1 class saved on this device</p>
      </div>
      <div class="class-stats" aria-live="polite">
        <div><strong id="studentTotal">0</strong><span>students</span></div>
        <div><strong id="classPointsTotal">0</strong><span>class points</span></div>
        <div><strong id="topStageTotal">0</strong><span>200-point pets</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dashboard-actions">
        <button class="utility-button" id="privacyToggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">◉ Privacy display</button>
        <button class="utility-button" id="exportButton" type="button">↓ Export backup</button>
        <button class="utility-button" id="importButton" type="button">↑ Import backup</button>
        <button class="utility-button danger-button" id="resetButton" type="button">Reset class</button>
        <input id="importFile" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" hidden>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="pet-workspace">
      <aside class="pet-sidebar">
        <section class="app-card add-students-card" aria-labelledby="addStudentsTitle">
          <p class="section-kicker">Set up your roster</p>
          <h2 id="addStudentsTitle">Add students</h2>
          <form id="addStudentsForm">
            <label for="studentNames">One nickname, initial, or number per line</label>
            <textarea id="studentNames" rows="7" maxlength="1600" placeholder="Student 01&#10;Student 02&#10;Student 03"></textarea>
            <p class="field-note">New students receive different pets until all 24 have been used.</p>
            <button class="primary-button" type="submit">Add students &amp; assign pets</button>
          </form>
        </section>

        <section class="app-card growth-guide" aria-labelledby="growthGuideTitle">
          <p class="section-kicker">Hatch, grow, and sparkle</p>
          <h2 id="growthGuideTitle">Growth stages</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><span>🥚</span><div><strong>Egg</strong><small>0–9 points</small></div></li>
            <li><span>🐣</span><div><strong>Cracked Egg</strong><small>10–19 points</small></div></li>
            <li><span>🐾</span><div><strong>Baby</strong><small>20–49 points</small></div></li>
            <li><span>💛</span><div><strong>Chubby Form</strong><small>50–99 points</small></div></li>
            <li><span>🌟</span><div><strong>Cute Adult</strong><small>100–149 points</small></div></li>
            <li><span>✨</span><div><strong>Sparkle Form</strong><small>150–199 · complete at 200</small></div></li>
            <li><span>🎁</span><div><strong>Holiday Skin</strong><small>Teacher-selected anytime</small></div></li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="app-card history-card" aria-labelledby="historyTitle">
          <div class="section-heading-row">
            <div>
              <p class="section-kicker">Easy to review</p>
              <h2 id="historyTitle">Recent activity</h2>
            </div>
            <button class="text-button" id="clearHistoryButton" type="button">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div id="historyList" class="history-list"></div>
        </section>
      </aside>

      <section class="roster-panel app-card" aria-labelledby="rosterTitle">
        <div class="roster-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="section-kicker">Your class</p>
            <h2 id="rosterTitle">Pet roster <span id="visibleCount"></span></h2>
          </div>
          <button class="undo-button" id="undoButton" type="button" disabled>↶ Undo last points change</button>
        </div>

        <div class="roster-toolbar">
          <label class="search-field">
            <span class="sr-only">Search students</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
            <input id="studentSearch" type="search" placeholder="Find a student" autocomplete="off">
          </label>
          <label class="sort-field">
            <span>Sort</span>
            <select id="studentSort">
              <option value="added">Recently added</option>
              <option value="name">Name A–Z</option>
              <option value="points-high">Points: high to low</option>
              <option value="points-low">Points: low to high</option>
              <option value="stage">Growth form</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="empty-state" id="emptyState">
          <div class="empty-pet" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <h3>Your pet class is ready to begin!</h3>
          <p>Add nicknames or student numbers on the left. Each student will receive one of 24 original pets.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pet-grid" id="petGrid" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <p class="no-results" id="noResults" hidden>No students match that search.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="teacher-tips app-card" aria-labelledby="teacherTipsTitle">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">Keep rewards meaningful</p>
        <h2 id="teacherTipsTitle">A simple classroom rhythm</h2>
      </div>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Name the behavior.</strong><span>“You earned a point for helping your group get started.”</span></li>
        <li><strong>Use small changes.</strong><span>Give +1 most often so each growth stage feels earned.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Celebrate growth.</strong><span>Pause when a pet reaches a new form; avoid comparing students publicly.</span></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>

  <dialog class="pet-picker" id="petPicker" aria-labelledby="petPickerTitle">
    <div class="dialog-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">24 original companions</p>
        <h2 id="petPickerTitle">Choose a pet</h2>
        <p id="petPickerStudent"></p>
      </div>
      <button class="dialog-close" id="closePetPicker" type="button" aria-label="Close pet picker">×</button>
    </div>
    <div class="pet-picker-grid" id="petPickerGrid"></div>
  </dialog>

  <dialog class="pet-picker skin-picker" id="skinPicker" aria-labelledby="skinPickerTitle">
    <div class="dialog-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">The animal stays the same</p>
        <h2 id="skinPickerTitle">Choose a holiday skin</h2>
        <p id="skinPickerStudent"></p>
      </div>
      <button class="dialog-close" id="closeSkinPicker" type="button" aria-label="Close holiday skin picker">×</button>
    </div>
    <p class="skin-picker-note">Add or remove a seasonal decoration whenever it fits your class calendar. Holiday skins do not change points or growth.</p>
    <div class="skin-picker-grid" id="skinPickerGrid"></div>
  </dialog>

  <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <noscript><p class="noscript-note">Class Pet Points needs JavaScript enabled to save and update the roster.</p></noscript>
  <script src="/teaching-tools/class-pet-points/class-pet-points.js"></script>
  <script src="/javascripts/account-coming-soon.js"></script>
  <script src="/javascripts/milk-tea-footer.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
